      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u07_2",
        "desc": "Beads threads z-i-p: the zipper on Hedgie's jacket zips itself up with a zing and a new stepping stone rises beside him. The friends have a picnic on a big flat stone: Bun dips a potato chip into a bowl of creamy dip and has a big blob of dip on her lip; Pip laughs; Hedgie pats his zipped-up jacket happily. Hidden in the picture: the zipper, the bowl of dip, Bun's lip. Grumble does NOT appear.",
