      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u07_3",
        "desc": "The orange cat sits on top of an open white first-aid kit on a stepping stone; Bun swings a wooden baseball bat and hits a peach pit far out over the pond with motion lines and a splash; Hedgie covers his ears; Beads threads s-i-t. In the reeds, Grumble covers both ears with his paws at the noise, his lantern glowing at his feet. Hidden in the picture: the sitting cat, the kit, the bat hitting the pit, the peach pit.",
