        "desc": "Everyone sits in a row on the new -ip and -it stepping stones with their feet in the water: Bun, Hedgie with the first-aid kit on his lap, the cat, Beads, and Pip, who finally says the word the right way and glows. At the end of the row Grumble has come out of the reeds and sits down shyly on the last stone with his lantern beside him — the first time he sits with the friends. Hidden in the picture: the kit, the sitting cat, the zipped jacket.",
